Package: bully
Type: Package
Title: A Taunting Word Guessing Game
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Sabrina", "Myracle",
      email = "sabrina.b.myracle@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre","cph")
    )
  )
Description: Try to guess the word, that our Bully the computer has picked from its only slightly biased,
     but very large word bank. The catch is that for every wrong guess you will be taunted.
    There's an escape entry to free up your console but you will leave with out dignity either.
    This is a package where the snark runs deep, each functions name reveals what Bully is really thinking. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
